actions: log | [ | actions: previous pane | actions: previous tab | ] and [ switch the tabs; tab and shift+tab still move between the panes
actions: log | ] | actions: pane | actions: tab | ] and [ switch the tabs; tab and shift+tab still move between the panes
actions: log | ctrl+r | actions: refresh | actions: rerun failed | ctrl+r re-runs the failed jobs; r still refreshes
actions: log | f | log: page down | actions: filter | f opens the filter; pgdown still pages down
actions: log | h | log: left | actions: pane left | h and l move between the panes; the arrows still scroll the log
actions: log | l | log: right | actions: pane right | h and l move between the panes; the arrows still scroll the log
